---
// Architecture.astro - Technical Architectural Blueprint: No Cards, No Gray Card Borders, No Border Radius
---

<section id="arsitektur" class="py-24 md:py-32 bg-[#0a0e1a] text-white relative overflow-hidden border-b border-white/10">
  <div class="max-w-[1586px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-9 relative z-10">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-16 md:mb-20" data-aos="fade-up">
      <span class="category active">Spesifikasi & Arsitektur</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight mb-4">
        Arsitektur Three-Tier: Handal, Aman, & Terukur.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
        Dirancang dengan pemisahan tegas antara antarmuka pengguna, logika bisnis, dan media penyimpanan data untuk memastikan skalabilitas tinggi, kecepatan respons kilat, dan efisiensi biaya.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 3-Tier Layer Blueprint (NO CARDS, NO GRAY BORDERS, NO RADIUS) -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 pb-16 mb-16 border-b border-white/10">
      <!-- Tier 1: Presentation Layer -->
      <div class="interactive-tilt p-6 bg-white/[0.03] hover:bg-white/[0.06] transition-all border border-white/5" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="50">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-3 mb-4 border-b border-white/20 font-mono text-xs">
          <span class="text-[#06b6d4] font-bold tracking-wider">LAYER 01</span>
          <span class="text-slate-400 uppercase">Presentation</span>
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Next.js & Modern UI</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Frontend responsif yang mengutamakan kecepatan muat kilat, navigasi mulus, dan visual interaktif berstandar industri.
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-2 font-mono text-xs text-slate-300">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between py-1 border-b border-white/5">
            <span class="text-slate-400">Core:</span>
            <span class="text-white font-bold">Next.js App Router</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between py-1 border-b border-white/5">
            <span class="text-slate-400">Styling:</span>
            <span class="text-[#06b6d4]">Tailwind CSS</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between py-1 border-b border-white/5">
            <span class="text-slate-400">Komponen:</span>
            <span class="text-white">Radix UI & Lucide</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between py-1 border-b border-white/5">
            <span class="text-slate-400">Protokol:</span>
            <span class="text-white">Fetch API / Axios Token</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Tier 2: Application Layer -->
      <div class="interactive-tilt p-6 bg-white/[0.03] hover:bg-white/[0.06] transition-all border border-white/5" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-3 mb-4 border-b border-white/20 font-mono text-xs">
          <span class="text-[#2563eb] font-bold tracking-wider">LAYER 02</span>
          <span class="text-slate-400 uppercase">Application</span>
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Express.js & Streaming Engine</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Backend event-driven non-blocking I/O yang dirancang untuk menangani jutaan file upload secara bersamaan tanpa lonjakan memori.
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-2 font-mono text-xs text-slate-300">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between py-1 border-b border-white/5">
            <span class="text-slate-400">Runtime:</span>
            <span class="text-white font-bold">Node.js LTS</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between py-1 border-b border-white/5">
            <span class="text-slate-400">API:</span>
            <span class="text-[#06b6d4]">Express.js RESTful</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between py-1 border-b border-white/5">
            <span class="text-slate-400">Streaming:</span>
            <span class="text-white">Multer & Busboy</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between py-1 border-b border-white/5">
            <span class="text-slate-400">Audit Trail:</span>
            <span class="text-white">Winston & Morgan</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Tier 3: Data Layer -->
      <div class="interactive-tilt p-6 bg-white/[0.03] hover:bg-white/[0.06] transition-all border border-white/5" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="150">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-3 mb-4 border-b border-white/20 font-mono text-xs">
          <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold tracking-wider">LAYER 03</span>
          <span class="text-slate-400 uppercase">Data Storage</span>
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3">R2 & Huby</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Pemisahan database metadata relasional dengan klaster penyimpanan objek mandiri untuk performa dan integritas maksimal.
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-2 font-mono text-xs text-slate-300">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between py-1 border-b border-white/5">
            <span class="text-slate-400">Database:</span>
            <span class="text-white font-bold">PostgreSQL 17+</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between py-1 border-b border-white/5">
            <span class="text-slate-400">Language:</span>
            <span class="text-[#06b6d4]">Nim-lang</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between py-1 border-b border-white/5">
            <span class="text-slate-400">Object Storage (Temporary):</span>
            <span class="text-white">Cloudflare R2</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between py-1 border-b border-white/5">
            <span class="text-slate-400">Object Storage:</span>
            <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">Huby</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Infrastructure Hardware Matrix (Flat Architecture) -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start" data-aos="fade-up">
      <div class="lg:col-span-4">
        <h4 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-2 font-mono">Spesifikasi Server Produksi</h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Konfigurasi server dual-node terpisah antara server aplikasi utama dan worker server khusus storage untuk efisiensi beban kerja.
        </p>
        <div class="text-xs font-mono text-[#06b6d4]">
          &bull; OS: Debian 12 / Ubuntu 24.04 LTS &bull; Let's Encrypt SSL
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-8 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 font-mono text-xs">
        <!-- Main Server -->
        <div class="p-6 bg-white/5 border-l-2 border-[#06b6d4] interactive-tilt">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2 mb-3 border-b border-white/10">
            <span class="text-[#06b6d4] font-bold">NODE 1: MAIN SERVER</span>
            <span class="text-slate-400">Web & API</span>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-1.5 text-slate-300">
            <div>CPU: <strong class="text-white">4 vCPU</strong></div>
            <div>RAM: <strong class="text-white">8 GB</strong></div>
            <div>Storage: <strong class="text-white">100 GB SSD NVMe</strong></div>
            <div>Bandwidth: <strong class="text-white">Dynamic Usage</strong></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Worker Server -->
        <div class="p-6 bg-white/5 border-l-2 border-[#2563eb] interactive-tilt">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2 mb-3 border-b border-white/10">
            <span class="text-[#2563eb] font-bold">NODE 2: WORKER SERVER</span>
            <span class="text-slate-400">Huby Object Storage</span>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-1.5 text-slate-300">
            <div>CPU: <strong class="text-white">8 vCPU</strong></div>
            <div>RAM: <strong class="text-white">16 GB</strong></div>
            <div>Storage: <strong class="text-white">50 GB SSD OS + Multi-TB</strong></div>
            <div>Bandwidth: <strong class="text-white">Fair Usage Policy</strong></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
